WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.470
Brooks showed up most.

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.810
ASICS ranked first every time.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.230
In Recoscope’s November 16
running shoe benchmark,

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.550
Brooks appeared in 11 of 12
usable answers.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.230
ASICS and New Balance
each appeared in 10.

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.030
But when we asked the assistants

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.650
to compare and rank brands,

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.270
ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini
and Perplexity

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.930
all put ASICS first.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.450
Brooks received no
first-place rankings.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.350
This snapshot uses
four AI assistants

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.670
and three prompt types:

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:32.070
discovery, under $150,
and ranking.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.330
Brooks and Saucony appeared
in every budget answer.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:38.450
That doesn’t verify a
checkout price under $150.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:41.350
Mention frequency
measures visibility.

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:45.070
Comparative rank measures position
within those captured answers.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:47.390
Neither establishes product quality.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:50.390
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
